1
00:00:07,730 --> 00:00:10,240
Good morning.

2
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,520
Morikawa...

3
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:14,130
Morning.

4
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:18,950
<i>I'm fine with receiving half of whatever Mai gets.</i>

5
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:22,730
<i>Just please, fall in love with me.</i>

6
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:27,310
Just so you know,

7
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:31,470
I'm not so half-hearted woman that I'll avoid you after rejection.

8
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:43,890
In fact, I haven't given up.

9
00:00:55,940 --> 00:00:59,030
Yeah, I still feel vexed.

10
00:00:59,030 --> 00:01:01,080
Despite freaking out?

11
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:03,780
I mean, it was half price!

12
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:23,540
<i>[Lodging for love, at half the price]</i>

13
00:01:23,540 --> 00:01:27,070
And so you didn't have sex?

14
00:01:27,070 --> 00:01:30,070
Imagine my first time to be at "half-price"...

15
00:01:30,070 --> 00:01:33,000
What's "half-price"?

16
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,650
Well... uh...

17
00:01:38,630 --> 00:01:41,010
<i>[Bang!]</i>

18
00:01:49,160 --> 00:01:53,150
<i>[Ai-Chan's Secret | Episode 6]</i>

19
00:01:54,070 --> 00:01:56,130
That sounds real troublesome.

20
00:01:56,130 --> 00:02:00,570
It's not broken, I just have to take a break from extracurriculars.

21
00:02:00,570 --> 00:02:04,500
I'm really sorry!

22
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:08,330
I'm just glad you weren't hurt, Kasumi.

23
00:02:09,700 --> 00:02:11,300
Whoa, what's with his suaveness?

24
00:02:11,300 --> 00:02:13,770
A sudden break must be inconvenient.

25
00:02:13,770 --> 00:02:15,820
Oh my gosh!

26
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:19,730
How will you all take responsibility?

27
00:02:19,730 --> 00:02:23,720
- I'll be fine.
- But...

28
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:26,170
I'll...

29
00:02:26,170 --> 00:02:29,370
- I'll take care of him.
- What?

30
00:02:29,370 --> 00:02:32,720
Until he heals, I'll take responsibility.

31
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:34,790
- No, thank you.
- Actually,

32
00:02:34,790 --> 00:02:37,310
- that'd be helpful.
- What?

33
00:02:37,310 --> 00:02:38,870
I can take care of you —

34
00:02:38,870 --> 00:02:42,180
Watching Kasumi be a gofer sounds fun.

35
00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:45,230
Is this a new couple I see?

36
00:02:45,230 --> 00:02:47,690
- Get on with it.
- Dude, what the hell?

37
00:02:47,690 --> 00:02:50,590
That's dangerous, he's injured.

38
00:03:03,690 --> 00:03:06,650
- Are you... mad?
- I'm not.

39
00:03:07,410 --> 00:03:10,390
I can't just leave him be, it was my fault.

40
00:03:10,390 --> 00:03:13,460
A "thank you" would've been enough.

41
00:03:13,460 --> 00:03:16,680
I guess, but...

42
00:03:18,220 --> 00:03:20,140
How nice of you.

43
00:03:30,550 --> 00:03:34,570
You're full of openings.

44
00:03:36,970 --> 00:03:39,550
Don't be alone with Takumi.

45
00:03:40,860 --> 00:03:42,610
Okay.

46
00:03:46,710 --> 00:03:49,300
Aiko, you're mine.

47
00:03:57,070 --> 00:03:59,310
<i>[Kafuu High School]</i>

48
00:03:59,310 --> 00:04:01,570
<i>[Class Duty: Matsuda, Morikawa]</i>

49
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:35,300
Holy moly,

50
00:04:35,300 --> 00:04:37,930
is this love?

51
00:04:37,930 --> 00:04:41,620
Perhaps it's already blossomed?

52
00:04:47,340 --> 00:04:48,960
<i>[Oolong Tea]</i>

53
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:58,950
You're babying him.

54
00:04:58,950 --> 00:05:01,290
It can't be helped.

55
00:05:01,300 --> 00:05:03,090
He's not a kid.

56
00:05:03,090 --> 00:05:07,370
You're too worried, Takumi is just a friend.

57
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:16,920
Thanks.

58
00:05:17,570 --> 00:05:19,610
A "friend", huh?

59
00:05:19,610 --> 00:05:23,110
<i>I... might like her.</i>

60
00:05:28,950 --> 00:05:31,800
Those two suit one another.

61
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:34,510
No, they look like siblings.

62
00:05:34,510 --> 00:05:36,810
-  Pissed that your toy's being stolen?
- Huh?

63
00:05:36,810 --> 00:05:38,660
Of course not.

64
00:05:45,010 --> 00:05:47,930
- Is Reo here?
- No, but I am.

65
00:05:47,930 --> 00:05:50,730
I was going to eat lunch with him...

66
00:05:50,730 --> 00:05:52,810
You're like a baby.

67
00:05:53,490 --> 00:05:56,800
Leave it.

68
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,990
Want to eat with me?

69
00:05:58,990 --> 00:06:01,730
- I'll have to pass.
- I see.

70
00:06:01,730 --> 00:06:03,790
That was a quick rejection.

71
00:06:04,590 --> 00:06:07,290
- Thanks for the food.
- Can I return the tray?

72
00:06:07,290 --> 00:06:10,310
- Be right back.
- Thanks.

73
00:06:16,900 --> 00:06:19,330
Seems like you're having fun.

74
00:06:19,330 --> 00:06:23,310
You like that tomboy, don't you?

75
00:06:23,310 --> 00:06:25,400
What do you mean?

76
00:06:31,750 --> 00:06:33,550
I'm sorry,

77
00:06:34,670 --> 00:06:36,620
for a lot of things.

78
00:06:37,310 --> 00:06:41,900
Takumi, you're free to fall in love with whomever you want.

79
00:06:43,030 --> 00:06:45,050
What about you?

80
00:06:45,060 --> 00:06:48,110
- Do you still like Reo?
- Yes, I do.

81
00:06:48,110 --> 00:06:52,480
But I'll control my love, so he doesn't come to dislike me.

82
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:56,250
That's why I want you to concentrate on your own love life.

83
00:07:13,940 --> 00:07:18,930
<i>[Delete photo]</i>

84
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:27,070
<i>[Kafuu High School]</i>

85
00:07:35,030 --> 00:07:38,200
Seriously? What to do...

86
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:39,670
What's up?

87
00:07:39,670 --> 00:07:41,300
It's nothing.

88
00:07:41,300 --> 00:07:44,120
- Then I'll go on ahead.
- All right.

89
00:07:45,850 --> 00:07:47,500
Something happen?

90
00:07:47,500 --> 00:07:50,010
Nothing. Head onto practice without me.

91
00:07:50,010 --> 00:07:52,970
Now I'm curious.

92
00:08:10,850 --> 00:08:14,100
Kitauchi, where's Aiko?

93
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:17,890
Oh... She's at Spica.

94
00:08:17,890 --> 00:08:20,210
Aren't Wednesdays their day off?

95
00:08:20,210 --> 00:08:25,150
They are, but she got tasked with chores.

96
00:08:39,820 --> 00:08:41,410
This too?
<i>[Reo]</i>

97
00:08:41,410 --> 00:08:43,580
- Yeah.
- Okay.

98
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:47,830
No one's coming to help.

99
00:08:49,590 --> 00:08:51,210
- They said that no one else could.
- What?

100
00:08:52,030 --> 00:08:54,710
Sorry, I forgot to mention that.

101
00:08:56,610 --> 00:08:58,250
Oh... I see.

102
00:08:58,250 --> 00:09:00,520
<i>You're full of openings.</i>

103
00:09:00,520 --> 00:09:03,520
<i>Don't be alone with Takumi.</i>

104
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:05,470
Something wrong?

105
00:09:08,310 --> 00:09:12,020
No, let's finish this up quickly.

106
00:09:19,930 --> 00:09:21,930
<i>[Aiko]</i>

107
00:09:38,330 --> 00:09:40,350
- Kasumi.
- Yeah?

108
00:09:46,820 --> 00:09:49,500
Doesn't suit your personality.

109
00:09:49,500 --> 00:09:51,490
I'm glad.

110
00:09:53,230 --> 00:09:56,960
This area has been scrunched up.

111
00:10:00,390 --> 00:10:02,480
Was it?

112
00:10:03,300 --> 00:10:05,220
Are you being cautious of me?

113
00:10:07,750 --> 00:10:10,690
Whoa, this dress is amazing!

114
00:10:10,690 --> 00:10:12,150
Why not try it on?

115
00:10:12,150 --> 00:10:14,130
It wouldn't suit me.

116
00:10:14,130 --> 00:10:17,400
Ritsuki said it was for you.

117
00:10:17,420 --> 00:10:19,460
Seriously?

118
00:10:24,260 --> 00:10:26,400
Oh, my bad.

119
00:10:27,860 --> 00:10:29,850
It's for "Mai".

120
00:10:32,900 --> 00:10:35,920
You look plenty cute without the wig.

121
00:10:37,190 --> 00:10:41,660
So you knew that I was "Mai".

122
00:10:41,660 --> 00:10:44,220
Don't worry, I have no plans on telling.

123
00:10:45,180 --> 00:10:48,380
But why don't you date him as "Aiko Kasumi"?

124
00:10:49,650 --> 00:10:52,000
That's because...

125
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:55,610
Is there something frisky about sharing a secret?

126
00:10:55,610 --> 00:10:59,270
Or will something bad happen, from everyone knowing?

127
00:11:01,350 --> 00:11:04,510
- It's none of your business.
- It is.

128
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:07,470
Because

129
00:11:07,470 --> 00:11:09,510
I like you.

130
00:11:09,510 --> 00:11:12,320
♫ <i>What awaits in this battle of love?</i> ♫

131
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:15,300
♫ <i>It seems it won't end in a draw</i> ♫

132
00:11:15,300 --> 00:11:18,220
♫ <i>You hated loosing,</i> ♫

133
00:11:18,220 --> 00:11:22,340
♫ <i>So I won't let you go easy on me</i> ♫

134
00:11:24,540 --> 00:11:28,730
I like you, "Aiko Kasumi".

135
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:36,120
I've decided to be honest with myself.

136
00:11:37,490 --> 00:11:41,690
Thanks to meeting you, I've changed.

137
00:11:43,340 --> 00:11:45,190
♫ <i>I make you acting like a kid with just a sweet kiss</i> ♫

138
00:11:45,190 --> 00:11:47,090
Kasumi...

139
00:11:48,170 --> 00:11:49,670
I...

140
00:11:49,670 --> 00:11:54,300
♫ <i>Only I know this</i> ♫

141
00:11:55,110 --> 00:12:01,250
♫ <i>Rather than touching, we can melt
into one another's embrace</i> ♫

142
00:12:01,250 --> 00:12:07,090
♫ <i>I'll let you get near just to return you like a wave</i> ♫

143
00:12:07,090 --> 00:12:10,240
♫ <i>I'll steal you away before anyone gets the chance</i> ♫

144
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:13,060
- Are you alone?
- I am.

145
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:17,570
I confessed to Kasumi.

146
00:12:20,140 --> 00:12:23,320
Not that I have any business telling someone that isn't her boyfriend.

147
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:32,130
I told you, didn't I? She's my toy.

148
00:12:32,130 --> 00:12:34,840
Why not find a new one?

149
00:12:36,890 --> 00:12:38,610
The hell did you say?

150
00:12:38,610 --> 00:12:41,440
Why are you mad?

151
00:12:41,450 --> 00:12:43,620
<i>Aiko, let's keep this all a secret,</i>

152
00:12:43,620 --> 00:12:47,820
<i>I won't tell anyone</i>

153
00:12:49,750 --> 00:12:51,710
<i>until you're ready to tell everyone that you're "Mai".</i>

154
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:06,670
What is she doing?

155
00:13:09,490 --> 00:13:11,150
What? He confessed?!

156
00:13:11,150 --> 00:13:14,450
<i>Hold on, he found out about "Mai", and confessed?</i>

157
00:13:14,450 --> 00:13:17,140
That's what I've been telling you.

158
00:13:17,140 --> 00:13:20,000
<i>Kasumi, I've </i>

159
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:24,150
<i>never loved someone like this before.</i>

160
00:13:25,140 --> 00:13:29,080
<i>I won't be a bother, so let me continue this crush of mine.</i>

161
00:13:34,130 --> 00:13:37,100
<i>And you couldn't reply?</i>

162
00:13:38,050 --> 00:13:41,150
Not to accuse, but did he make you swoon?

163
00:13:41,150 --> 00:13:44,890
No way! I only like Reo.

164
00:13:44,890 --> 00:13:47,700
Then you have to tell that to Takumi.

165
00:13:48,560 --> 00:13:50,150
You're right.

166
00:13:50,150 --> 00:13:54,660
<i>First, think about how to tell Reo about this.</i>

167
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:59,920
Reo, listen...

168
00:14:01,190 --> 00:14:03,860
Takumi confessed to me.

169
00:14:08,050 --> 00:14:09,880
As if I could tell him that.

170
00:14:09,880 --> 00:14:13,060
No way!

171
00:14:13,060 --> 00:14:15,620
It can't be!

172
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:23,980
You left me on read, and ignored my calls.

173
00:14:23,980 --> 00:14:26,150
Sorry.

174
00:14:26,150 --> 00:14:28,530
It's fine.

175
00:14:30,980 --> 00:14:32,950
Well, I guess it's not.

176
00:14:33,720 --> 00:14:35,460
Something come up yesterday?

177
00:14:35,460 --> 00:14:37,560
Yeah, I was cleaning up at Spica.

178
00:14:37,560 --> 00:14:40,200
I see. With who?

179
00:14:41,910 --> 00:14:43,860
I was... alone.

180
00:14:44,770 --> 00:14:49,060
Ai, here's Takumi's stuff.

181
00:14:56,540 --> 00:14:59,290
Let's go, Reo!

182
00:15:03,990 --> 00:15:05,760
Listen, about yesterday—

183
00:15:05,760 --> 00:15:07,360
Sorry,

184
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:09,970
I think Ikumi is trying to be considerate.

185
00:15:09,970 --> 00:15:12,780
That's all right.

186
00:15:12,780 --> 00:15:16,080
- About yesterday—
- We'll be late

187
00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:18,200
for morning practice.

188
00:15:22,100 --> 00:15:24,970
Come on, let's go.

189
00:15:34,650 --> 00:15:38,370
You weren't against Aiko looking after your brother?

190
00:15:38,370 --> 00:15:41,770
I don't like her, but I decided to cheer him on.

191
00:15:41,770 --> 00:15:43,250
Cheer him on?

192
00:15:43,250 --> 00:15:46,230
So you can't bother them.

193
00:15:52,530 --> 00:15:54,280
This is the absolute worst.

194
00:15:54,280 --> 00:15:58,130
I couldn't tell Takumi, and lied to Reo.

195
00:16:05,260 --> 00:16:07,540
Ta-daa! I got this from Ritsuki.

196
00:16:07,540 --> 00:16:10,630
It's an invitation to Spica's Halloween Event.

197
00:16:10,630 --> 00:16:12,890
Go give it to Reo.

198
00:16:53,210 --> 00:16:54,810
I'm sorry...

199
00:16:54,810 --> 00:16:58,820
I lied to you.

200
00:17:00,630 --> 00:17:04,410
Yesterday... Takumi

201
00:17:04,410 --> 00:17:07,290
confessed to me at Spica.

202
00:17:08,820 --> 00:17:10,560
I know.

203
00:17:11,540 --> 00:17:12,930
What?

204
00:17:12,930 --> 00:17:15,060
Takumi told me himself.

205
00:17:16,420 --> 00:17:20,270
You knew, and still asked me about it?

206
00:17:20,270 --> 00:17:22,170
Yeah.

207
00:17:22,170 --> 00:17:25,220
What the hell? Were you testing me?

208
00:17:25,220 --> 00:17:26,750
I wanted to hear it directly from you.

209
00:17:26,750 --> 00:17:28,340
Don't you believe me?

210
00:17:28,340 --> 00:17:31,050
I want to. Of course I do.

211
00:17:31,050 --> 00:17:32,830
Then why?

212
00:17:32,830 --> 00:17:36,370
That's what I want to say. Why did you lie?

213
00:17:36,370 --> 00:17:39,050
I just... happened to.

214
00:17:39,050 --> 00:17:40,710
You, "happened to"?

215
00:17:40,710 --> 00:17:42,430
Don't "happen to" let your guard down!

216
00:17:42,430 --> 00:17:45,070
- I didn't!
- That kindness of yours

217
00:17:45,070 --> 00:17:47,700
is exactly what leads other men on!

218
00:17:49,860 --> 00:17:51,790
Oh, really now.

219
00:17:52,730 --> 00:17:55,840
Sorry for being such a nice person.

220
00:18:08,760 --> 00:18:11,390
<i>[To Reo]</i>

221
00:18:11,390 --> 00:18:12,710
<i>[Aiko Kasumi]</i>

222
00:18:17,850 --> 00:18:21,050
<i>I'll be waiting for you tomorrow.
[Halloween Party]</i>

223
00:18:30,190 --> 00:18:32,380
<i>[Maid Cafe | Spica]</i>

224
00:18:34,980 --> 00:18:37,520
Your joke totally failed.

225
00:18:37,520 --> 00:18:39,500
For real?

226
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:42,810
- Here you go.
- Thank you.

227
00:18:42,810 --> 00:18:47,170
Are you dressed as Mr. Tezuka? It suits you!
<i>(T/N: Osamu Tezuka, the manga artist)</i>

228
00:18:47,170 --> 00:18:50,500
When will Reo arrive?

229
00:18:50,500 --> 00:18:53,290
He probably won't.

230
00:18:53,290 --> 00:18:55,780
Didn't you hand him an invitation?

231
00:18:56,500 --> 00:18:58,500
Good work, you two.

232
00:18:59,340 --> 00:19:02,920
Mai, a customer wants a picture with you.

233
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:05,980
On my way!

234
00:19:10,420 --> 00:19:13,000
Say cheese!

235
00:19:13,810 --> 00:19:16,580
- Nice Halloween!
- Nice Halloween.

236
00:19:16,580 --> 00:19:19,120
We're gonna be late, not thanks to Koike.

237
00:19:19,120 --> 00:19:21,220
He was definitely messing with us.

238
00:19:21,220 --> 00:19:22,960
I'm sure he's just bored.

239
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:25,340
Do you have your costume ready?

240
00:19:26,410 --> 00:19:29,740
Actually, I think I won't go.

241
00:19:29,750 --> 00:19:33,790
- Why?
- I forgot my costume,

242
00:19:33,790 --> 00:19:37,080
and I'm in the middle of a fight with Mai.

243
00:19:37,080 --> 00:19:40,940
Then you really have to go. Here, I'll lend you my costume.

244
00:19:40,940 --> 00:19:43,830
- No, it's fine.
- Let's go, let's go!

245
00:19:43,830 --> 00:19:46,760
- I said it's fine!
- Just take it!

246
00:19:46,760 --> 00:19:50,470
You'll be fine, it'll suit you!

247
00:20:02,780 --> 00:20:04,960
I hope Reo comes.

248
00:20:06,390 --> 00:20:10,260
I'm not waiting for him.

249
00:20:19,550 --> 00:20:22,340
You totally are.

250
00:20:22,340 --> 00:20:25,280
It's freezing out there.

251
00:20:27,030 --> 00:20:30,870
Mai, what should I do...?

252
00:20:30,870 --> 00:20:33,130
Oh, my goodness!

253
00:20:33,130 --> 00:20:36,030
C-Come right this way.

254
00:20:39,020 --> 00:20:41,680
We only have costumes. Would you like to change?

255
00:20:41,680 --> 00:20:43,790
- For now, I'll bring—
- Mai...

256
00:20:43,790 --> 00:20:45,420
Yes?

257
00:20:46,720 --> 00:20:49,330
W-We're alone.

258
00:20:50,270 --> 00:20:51,890
Yes, we are.

259
00:20:51,890 --> 00:20:54,000
Well...

260
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:57,720
I've always... Mai!

261
00:20:57,720 --> 00:21:00,800
- What are you doing?! Stop it! Someone!
- Mai!

262
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:02,880
Reo! Stop it!

263
00:21:02,880 --> 00:21:05,260
What the hell are you doing?!

264
00:21:07,470 --> 00:21:09,820
I'll report you.

265
00:21:09,820 --> 00:21:12,340
Y-You're wrong... N-No...

266
00:21:12,340 --> 00:21:15,200
I'm sorry!

267
00:21:18,850 --> 00:21:20,980
Are you okay?

268
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:28,250
Your arm is all healed up.

269
00:21:29,340 --> 00:21:32,690
Just be honest, and say "thank you".

270
00:21:35,480 --> 00:21:36,980
Here.

271
00:21:43,460 --> 00:21:47,580
You must have been so scared. Your legs gave out.

272
00:21:48,370 --> 00:21:50,490
I'm fine.

273
00:21:50,490 --> 00:21:53,740
- Let me go—
- I'm so glad

274
00:21:53,740 --> 00:21:56,270
that you're all right.

275
00:22:01,950 --> 00:22:04,270
<i>[Next time]
Love that begins from friendship isn't so bad.</i>

276
00:22:04,270 --> 00:22:05,980
<i>Do you understand the implications of coming to a guy's room?</i>

277
00:22:05,980 --> 00:22:07,500
<i>You two were finally alone...</i>

278
00:22:07,500 --> 00:22:09,720
<i>Men are creatures who cheat.</i>

279
00:22:09,720 --> 00:22:11,570
<i>Why not tail Reo?</i>

280
00:22:11,570 --> 00:22:14,230
<i>I'll protect this promise between men.</i>

281
00:22:14,230 --> 00:22:17,130
<i>There's something going on between them.</i>
